Hello,<br />
Thank you for wanting to host a blood drive.&nbsp; Our Blood Program Sponsors are very important to helping us ensure a safe and reliable blood supply for our hospitals and patients.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
Our process for hosting a drive is a 12 week timeline.&nbsp; Now is the time for you to survey your donor pool to determine how many donors will participate in your blood drive program.&nbsp; I am attaching an Interest Survey for you to keep track of the generous donors who say YES! to saving lives.&nbsp; (We need 35-40 people interested in donating in order secure the resources for a mobile blood drive).&nbsp; Should you have fewer than this, please visit ask your donors to visit www.redcrossblood.org and enter their zip code to find a blood drive convenient for them.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Attached, please find the survey and a Blood Program Sponsor Sheet to help you understand your role.<br />
Your account manager has been copied on this email and will be in touch with you shortly.<br />
<br />
Thanks in advance,<br />
